<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAR 26.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAR 26.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Mar 26	Mar 24     Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  266.350     266.400     247.020    7.83 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  306.520     305.640     306.830   -0.10 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.785     157.565     158.970   -0.75 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.800	46.734	47.182   -0.81 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  432.000     428.400     419.180    3.06 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.260     140.020     141.685   -1.01 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.771	15.748	16.185   -2.56 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  214.700     216.870     212.430    1.07 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.858	 1.859	 1.888   -1.59 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.568	 1.570	 1.581   -0.82 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  181.760     182.225     183.135   -0.75%</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
